index a6adcc6..4127e9c 100644
--- a/docs/skills.md
+++ b/docs/skills.md
@@ -130,6 +130,8 @@ pi skills remove browser-testing-with-devtools --repo
 
 `--session` is interactive-only and lasts until the session ends. `--global` and `--repo` persist to their respective JSON configuration. `list` and `search` show catalog skills. `pi skills active` shows the configured global and repository entries; `/skills active` also shows session entries.
 
+Path arguments may use `~`, `$NAME`, or `${NAME}`. `/skills` expands them itself because its arguments never pass through a shell, and `add` stores the expanded absolute path so the entry resolves the same way from any working directory. Hand-written entries in `skills.json` and `repo-skills.json` are expanded the same way when Pi loads them; a relative entry resolves against the working directory, so prefer absolute or `~` paths.
+
 Use `--no-skills` to suppress global and repository active skills; explicit `--skill` paths still load.
 
